# Never upload operational backups or credentials
**/yaqintop_db.json*
**/supabase_sync_meta.json*
**/database-backups/
**/database-snapshots/
**/*.dump
**/*.bak
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.local/
**/*.enc
**/*.enc.key
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
